# DISTYNC uses separate frontend and backend environment files.
# Copy the templates below and set an explicit access mode in each one.
#
# Frontend template: client/.env.example
# Backend template: server/.env.example
#
# No access mode defaults exist. The frontend requires VITE_ACCESS_MODE and
# the backend requires SERVER_ACCESS_MODE.
# Exact uppercase values only: DEVELOPMENT or DEMO.
# Official production deployments use DEMO on both layers.
